sequenceDiagram
    participant cc as CC process
    participant shell as Shell loop<br/>(while true)
    participant tmux as tmux session<br/>(remain-on-exit on)
    participant bridge as Bridge (UDS)
    participant daemon as Daemon<br/>(onRunDisconnect)

    Note over shell,tmux: Non-fork spawn wraps CC in a while-true loop.<br/>remain-on-exit keeps tmux alive after pane death.<br/>isAlive uses sessionProcessAlive (pane_dead), not tmuxHasSession.

    rect rgb(40, 60, 40)
        Note over cc,bridge: Normal operation
        cc->>bridge: connected
        bridge->>daemon: bridge registered
    end

    rect rgb(60, 40, 40)
        Note over cc,daemon: CC self-exit — pane survives (shell loop catches)
        cc->>cc: [uds-messaging] Shutting down
        cc->>shell: exit code 1
        cc-->>bridge: socket closes
        bridge->>daemon: bridge disconnected
        daemon->>daemon: start 15s timer
        shell->>shell: write exit marker + restart log
        shell->>shell: sleep 2
        shell->>cc: exec claude --resume (with tool flags)
        cc->>bridge: reconnects
        bridge->>daemon: bridge registered
        daemon->>daemon: onRunReconnect → re-prompt active actor
    end

    rect rgb(80, 40, 40)
        Note over cc,daemon: CC self-exit — pane destroyed (EIO teardown)
        cc->>cc: [uds-messaging] Shutting down
        cc->>tmux: EIO: terminal destroyed
        Note over tmux: Pane dead, session retained (remain-on-exit)
        cc-->>bridge: socket closes
        bridge->>daemon: bridge disconnected
        daemon->>daemon: start 15s timer
        Note over daemon: 15s timer fires
        daemon->>daemon: isAlive? → sessionProcessAlive → pane_dead=1 → false
        daemon->>daemon: resumeParticipant (with tool flags + re-prompt)
        Note over tmux: Dead pane cleaned up by new spawn
    end

    rect rgb(40, 40, 60)
        Note over bridge,daemon: Transient bridge disconnect (CC alive)
        bridge->>daemon: bridge disconnected
        daemon->>daemon: start 15s timer
        Note over daemon: 15s timer fires
        daemon->>daemon: isAlive? → sessionProcessAlive → pane_dead=0 → true
        daemon->>daemon: "tmux alive, rechecking in 15s"
        Note over daemon: recheck timer fires
        alt bridge reconnected
            daemon->>daemon: transport.has → true → cancel timer
        else still disconnected
            daemon->>daemon: startGraceTimer → cancelRun after grace
        end
    end

    rect rgb(60, 60, 40)
        Note over daemon: Daemon kills session
        daemon->>tmux: tmux kill-session
        tmux->>shell: SIGHUP
        Note over shell: Shell dies immediately<br/>(no trap, no restart)
    end
